  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Center for Insect Physiology and Ecology (ICIPE) is a   Nairobi-based research institute for development of tools and         strategies for controlling human, animal and plant pests and disease  vectors, and the developing technologies for insect-based             income-generating activities. PhD and MSc programmes in cooperation   with African universities is also part of ICIPE&#x2019;s mandate.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Center for Insect Physiology and Ecology (ICIPE) &#xe4;r ett forskningsinstitut baserat i Nairobi, Kenya som bedriver forskning    och utveckling kring metoder att kontrollera skadedjur inom           v&#xe4;xtodling, samt djur- och humanh&#xe4;lsa. ICIPE bedriver ocks&#xe5; en        omfattande kapacitetsuppbyggnad genom doktorand- och mastersprogram i samarbete med afrikanska universitet.</narrative>
  </description>
